# Katna service, English: the global shortcuts, as the desktop lists them
# (on KDE Plasma, System Settings > Keyboard > Shortcuts, under Katna Mail).
# Guide: i18n/README.md. Keep ids stable; change the text freely.

# Meta+Alt+T: opens the quick capture card on Task, over whatever is on
# screen.
shortcut-capture-task = New task (quick capture)
# Meta+Alt+N: opens the quick capture card on Note.
shortcut-capture-note = New note (quick capture)
